results of simple rules were compared with the ‘pattern recognition’ method and with histological findings. This 
validation study was included in the subsequent meta‐analysis, for which we searched MEDLINE, EMBASE and Cochrane from 
the publication of the first study in 2008. The terms used were ‘simple rules’, ‘simple rules ovarian’, ‘ovar tumor’ and
