│ CA-125. CONCLUSION HE4 offers superior specificity compared to CA-125 for the differentiation of benign and          │
│ malignant adnexal masses in premenopausal women."}, {"study_index": 82, "title": "HE4 as a serum biomarker for ROMA  │
│ prediction and prognosis of epithelial ovarian cancer", "abstract": "BACKGROUND AND PURPOSE Human epididymis protein │
│ 4 (HE4) has been suggested to be a novel biomarker of epithelial ovarian cancer (EOC). The present study aimed to    │
